# MadhvaNidhi implementation rule

`MOCKUP_ONLY = false` (authorized full-shell Android port). Full policy: [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

## Scope

- **Write:** `app/**`, freeze docs under `docs/`, mockup freeze marks under `prototypes/**`, `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, this rule
- **Allowed tooling:** `gradlew`, `adb`, debug install
- UI layout/IA source of truth = frozen mockups; Android visuals = Material Design 3

## Studio (mockup)

- Chrome = portrait screen-size selector + live iframe preview only
- Presets portrait only; custom `height > width`

## Design

- **Android:** Material Design 3 — `Theme.Material3.*`, `Widget.Material3.*`, `md_theme_*` (seed `#BA4E00`); rounded M3 corners; Material Icons Outlined
- Legacy `Widget.Carbon.*` / `carbon_*` may exist as M3 bridges; do not restore Carbon 0dp productive chrome on Android
- **Mockup:** `cds--*` / `--cds-*` only (moon glyph circle is the sole domain exception); do not redesign mockups to Material unless asked
- No Desk chrome or inventing non-M3 Android colours outside the seed palette

## Frozen screens (no layout redesign without new design pass)

- Panchanga — `docs/frozen-panchanga-shell.md`
- User profile — `docs/frozen-user-profile.md`
- Nitya Sandhya — `docs/frozen-nitya-sandhya.md`
- Nitya Japa — `docs/frozen-nitya-japa.md`
- Puja (rail) — `docs/frozen-nitya-puja.md`

## Portrait-first

Main shell is portrait (header + content + bottom rail). Content readers may use landscape. Do not restore landscape-only launcher locks.
